#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:54
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_ShadyCharactersCozmosHome"
msgid ""
"Something's happening,\n"
"and I don't like it!\p"
"I've seen shady characters wandering\n"
"in and out of PROF. COZMO's home…$"
msgstr ""
"好像出了什么事，我感觉很不妙！\p"
"我看到有些可疑的人在\n"
"宙石博士家进进出出……$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_RegionKnownForMeteors"
msgid ""
"This region's been known for meteors\n"
"since the olden days.\p"
"They say METEOR FALLS was gouged out\n"
"by a falling meteorite long ago.$"
msgstr ""
"这一带从很久以前就以流星而闻名。\p"
"据说流星瀑布就是\n"
"很久以前坠落的陨石砸出来的。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:66
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_MyPreciousAzurill"
msgid ""
"See! Take a look!\n"
"This is my precious AZURILL!\p"
"It's slick and smooth and plushy, too!$"
msgstr ""
"你看！快看！这是我最宝贝的露力丽！\p"
"它滑溜溜的，又软乎乎的！$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_Azurill"
msgid "AZURILL: Rooreelooo.$"
msgstr "露力丽：噜哩噜——$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:74
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_HaveYouChallengedFlannery"
msgid ""
"Have you already challenged FLANNERY,\n"
"the LEADER of LAVARIDGE GYM?\p"
"The girl's grandfather was famous.\n"
"He was one of the ELITE FOUR in the\l"
"POKéMON LEAGUE at one point.\p"
"It wouldn't surprise me to see FLANNERY\n"
"become a great TRAINER in her own\l"
"right.$"
msgstr ""
"你已经挑战过釜炎道馆的馆主亚莎了吗？\p"
"那女孩的爷爷可是很有名的。\n"
"他曾经是宝可梦联盟的四天王之一。\p"
"就算亚莎凭自己的实力成为了不起的\n"
"训练家，我也一点都不会惊讶。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_BattleTentSign"
msgid ""
"BATTLE TENT FALLARBOR SITE\n"
"“May the Greatest Teams Gather!”$"
msgstr ""
"对战帐篷 秋叶会场\n"
"“最强的队伍，在此集结！”$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:88
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_TownSign"
msgid ""
"FALLARBOR TOWN\n"
"“A farm community with small gardens.”$"
msgstr ""
"秋叶镇\n"
"“拥有小小田园的农村”$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown/scripts.inc:92
msgctxt "FallarborTown_Text_MoveTutorSign"
msgid ""
"MOVE TUTOR'S HOUSE\n"
"“New moves taught to POKéMON.”$"
msgstr ""
"招式教学人之家\n"
"“教宝可梦学会新招式。”$"
